### Cadastro → 201 (role USER)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Carlos Teste", "email": "carlos@fit.com", "password": "carlos123"}

### Login do aluno → 200 {token, expiresIn}
# @name loginAna
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@fit.com", "password": "ana123"}

> {% client.global.set("anaToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login do admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@fit.com", "password": "admin123"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### Listar (página 0, 10 aulas, ordenadas por startsAt)
GET http://localhost:8080/classes

### Segunda página, 5 por página
GET http://localhost:8080/classes?page=1&size=5

### Query by Example
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/example?modality=YOGA&level=BEGINNER&instructor=carla mendes

### Specification: título, modalidade, faixa de horário e só com vaga
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/search?title=yoga&modality=YOGA&availableOnly=true&startsAfter=2026-01-01T00:00:00

### Uma aula (como aluno: aparece o link enroll quando há vaga)
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Aula inexistente → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/999

### Criar aula (ADMIN) → 201 + Location
POST http://localhost:8080/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Funcional ao ar livre",
  "modality": "FUNCTIONAL",
  "level": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "instructor": "Rafael Souza",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "capacity": 15
}

### Criar como aluno → 403 {"error": "..."}
POST http://localhost:8080/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Nao pode", "modality": "YOGA", "level": "BEGINNER", "instructor": "X", "startsAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00", "durationMinutes": 45, "capacity": 15}

### Criar sem token → 401 {"error": "..."}
POST http://localhost:8080/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Atualizar (ADMIN) → 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Yoga reformulado",
  "modality": "YOGA",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "instructor": "Carla Mendes",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-02T07:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "capacity": 30
}

### Excluir (ADMIN) → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/classes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Inscrever-se → 201 (409 se lotada ou já inscrito)
POST http://localhost:8080/classes/3/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Minhas inscrições (paginado)
GET http://localhost:8080/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Cancelar inscrição → 204 (dono ou ADMIN; 403 se for de outro aluno)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/enrollments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
